1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,291
Stanza two mirrors the first.

2
00:00:02,291 --> 00:00:09,622
Every morning becomes every evening, and the prayer for all creatures becomes a blessing on one small town.

3
00:00:09,622 --> 00:00:13,489
The poem has the shape of a day, and of the whole play.

4
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:18,359
Then the frankest line: whether they last the night is always touch and go.

5
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:20,247
It means highly uncertain.

6
00:00:20,247 --> 00:00:24,270
It is an astonishingly plain thing for a clergyman to say.

7
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:28,710
He promises no protection; faith does not remove the risk.

